    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Madden are delighted to bring to the market this delightful residence located c.2km from Portumna town centre, with both primary and secondary schools together with a host of social and recreational amenities to include Portumna Forest Park, Portumna Castle and Gardens and the majestic Lough Derg literally on your doorstep.\n\nThis bright and spacious home set on 0.37 Acres offers one the opportunity to enjoy the peace and tranquility of country living in a most attractive and yet convenient location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.84m x 2.22m\nFront aspect door, French doors to hallway, tile flooring\n\nHallway - 13.53m x 1.06m\nHotpress/airing cupboard, fully shelved, carpet flooring\n\nSitting Room - 4.16m x 5.44m\nFront aspect window, Electric stove with brick surrond, wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.25m x 9.00m\nDual aspect windows, sliding door leading to garden, wall and base units, breakfast bar, tile flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.98m x 2.54m\nRear aspect window and door, tile flooring\n\nLounge/Dining Room - 3.54m x 3.63m\nRear aspect sliding door to garden, wooden flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.59m x 3.59m\nRear aspect window, whb/wc/bath with overhead shower, walls partially tiled, tile flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.83m x 3.64m\nRear aspect window, door leading to bathroom, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m x 3.61m\nRear aspect window, wooden flooring - Ensuite: 1.33m x 1.83m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/ electric shower, tile flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.51m x 3.59m\nFront aspect bay window, wooden flooring - Ensuite: 1.35m x 1.83m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/electric shower, tile flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.54m x 3.62m\nDual aspect windows, wooden flooring - Ensuite: 1.51m x 2.81m - Front aspect window, whb/wc/Electric shower, tile flooring\n\nGarden - \nGated sweeping driveway, set on 0.37 Acres, mature garden, laid to lawn with brick and hedge boundary\n\n"
